# Accepted image vulnerabilities (scripts/scan-images.sh).
#
# One CVE id per line, each with a comment naming who accepted it, when,
# and why the fix cannot be taken. Entries are reviewed whenever a base
# image digest moves — an accepted finding that the new base already fixes
# must be deleted, not carried forward.
#
# Empty by design: the gate scans for HIGH/CRITICAL findings that have a
# fix available, so an entry here is always a decision to ship a known,
# fixable vulnerability.
